      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey can u help me write a script for a podcast? its for this guy who has a \"common sense\" type of show. like a populist vibe, talking to regular people who are fed up with how things are run in the cities and the government. just a short intro and a topic reveal to get people hyped.",
